st["Stay: at the end of frame, Die()<br/>ForgePurge.PurgeOnDeath when Purges is set<br/>end the body, apply the OnDeath effects"]:::general
st2(["stays registered: its abilities refuse as Dead,<br/>and others' effects are refused"]):::terminator
